  note "Re-measured 2026-09-30 after the seeded creative, formalization, planning, and product-search interpreters were split into ledgered modules: 73 handler sources and 30942 total lines, with 51 promoted-core files contributing 20267 migration lines."
  note "Issue #1138 B9, plan 09 leaf 1 corrected the four handlers outside rust/src/solver_handlers. Plan 08 promoted the generic verifiable-task interpreter; the URL parsing split adds one recursively counted source but its structural parser reads language evidence from seed roles, so it is promoted core machinery rather than migration debt. Plan 09 leaf 17 registered the M2 retrieval interpreter as a component beside the census. Plan 09 leaf 18 retired the concept-lookup orchestration into rust/src/concepts.rs and the network, refresh, learn and conflict procedures into rust/src/retrieval_procedures.rs, lowering the dispatcher module and the two line ceilings by the same 350 lines. The leaf 18 landing then rebased the census on the committed tree: the verifiable-task interpreter that plan 08 promoted landed at 834 lines, not the 750 first recorded, because its derive family (flow signs, role offsets, unit conversion) that lowers seed-declared expectations into ProgramIr candidates grew past the early estimate; the dispatcher module settled at 582 lines after the 350-line retirement, and seven lines left the reviewed core outside the census, so both ceilings track the honest counts. Re-measured 2026-09-20 after the issue #1021 routing fix (e4f0b3ac4) and plan 09 leaf 41 (12aa51b29) landed with the ledger unrefreshed: solver_handler_how.rs gained the honest-gap and mutating-request precedence arms, solver_handler_units.rs and solver_handlers/pattern_inference.rs grew their seed-driven rules, for 72 net lines; both ceilings now record the measured 20439 and 19456 rather than the stale 20367 and 19384.Re-measured 2026-09-21 for the plan 16 L1 three-source-roots move; the crate sits under rust/ and every ledger path moved with it, the calendar-create split and the previously unledgered policy_gates.rs raise source_file_count_max to 53, eleven baselines re-record the measured tree, and ledgering the two previously uncounted rows raises both line ceilings to 20787 and 19857 with outside_core_file_count_max at 51.Re-measured 2026-09-22 after the recognition and routing batches landed with the ledger unrefreshed: calendar_create.rs gained the elliptical arm and clock-hour role of the entity-grounded hours work, conversation_summary.rs gained empty-history ownership so a summarize request never falls through ownerless, and software_project.rs gained its routing retirement, for 39 net lines; both ceilings record the measured 20826 and 19896.Re-measured 2026-09-22 after the specification-red batch (bb43dbe90) landed with the ledger unrefreshed: conversation_summary.rs gained the courtesy-frame guard that strips every courtesy and directive surface before an unknown fallback (164 to 194 lines), solver_unknown_reasoning.rs gained the bare-term escape and the merge-arm-decline gate, and solver_helpers gained the shared miss_names_consulted_sources helper, for 27 net lines; outside_core_lines_max records the measured 19923. The batch J clippy sweep (5e1cc2f3d) then reflowed two ledgered rows after that measure, calendar_create.rs losing three redundant lines and verifiable_task.rs gaining one, so source_lines_max records the measured 20854.Re-measured 2026-09-22 after the G4 recall-answer batch (a5db54c57) landed with the ledger unrefreshed; conversation_memory/mod.rs gained the seeded summary-answer arm that answers a summary request from the recorded conversation instead of routing it away (813 to 829 lines), and web_search_intent.rs shed two cue lines in the personal-facts paydown (902 to 900 lines), for 14 net lines; both ceilings record the measured 20868 and 19937.Re-measured 2026-09-25 for the plan 16 L2g landing (70a18ddf4): the new translate_write.rs std half (write_one and the transactional write_tree the CLI and the agent driver share), the source_tree_request recognizer in meta_translate.rs, and the translate_source_tree solver family in solver_handlers/mod.rs (586 to 651 lines) grew the tree by 65 net lines; both ceilings record the measured 20933 and 20002.Re-measured 2026-09-30 for the bulk QA, reasoning, and coding batch (issues #1172, #1173, #1174, #1175, #1176, #1177): thirteen new promote rows register the interpreters the batch delivered native with seed vocabulary (summarization_request, text_rewrite, the nine code-task handlers, statistics with word problems, unit_conversion), raising source_file_count_max to 66; the same batch grew calendar.rs (issue #1176 day-offset and week arithmetic), mod.rs (issue #1174 free-sentence translation arm plus the re-exports), software_project.rs (issue #1175 object-head boundary detection), benchmark_prompts.rs (issue #1172 word-boundary QA), and live_search.rs (issue #1173 fallback search execution) while web_requests.rs shrank by the same move, so both line ceilings record the measured 27459 and 20579. Re-measured again the same day for the issue #1175 vocabulary extraction: the multilingual phrase tables left software_project.rs (1167 to 843 lines) for the promoted software_project_phrases.rs interpreter (366 lines) reading data/seed/software-project-phrases.lino, the dispatcher module shed its unused re-exports for 767 lines, and the fourteenth promote row raises source_file_count_max to 67, with both line ceilings recording the measured 27499 and 20253."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 gate sweep. The R379 migration moved the constraint-check, planning-feasibility, brainstorming-constraint and advice-ordering prose of creative_writing.rs, creative_writing_planning.rs and creative_composition.rs, and the prover-presence and derivation lines of formalization_task_render.rs, into seed response records rendered through template calls and append_fields evidence entries, which take more lines than the format strings they replace; unit_conversion.rs now renders its SI refusals through SiConversion::describe and was reflowed by rustfmt. The clippy sweep of the same batch shrank or reflowed the remaining rows. source_lines_max records the measured 31106 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20255; every baseline is the measured tree."
  note "Re-measured again 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 delegated-task batch (R1017, issues #1175 and #1176). Five sources joined the ledger as promoted generic interpreters, by the same test the code-task and creative interpreters passed: calendar/date_weekday.rs and calendar/month.rs are civil-date arithmetic over seeded month names and weekday cues, statistics/primality.rs is trial division recognised through a seeded number property, and numeric_list/stated_result.rs and text_request_framing.rs apply the seeded operation vocabulary; none embeds domain vocabulary or a canned answer, and each keeps its parent under the 1000-line gate. Seven rows grew with the arms that dispatch to them and with the routing fixes recorded in their reasons. source_lines_max records the measured 32237 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20398 (calendar_create.rs and unit_conversion.rs grew with the #1175 routing fixes); every baseline is the measured tree. The growth is new computed capability in both runtimes, not regrowth of migrated prose; migration debt grows only through the seven re-measured rows."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 code-probe routing batch: the code-task family shares one code_block extractor (three identical copies removed), and try_algorithm, numeric_list and text_manipulation gained seed-driven arms (the multilingual sort operation; a format-conversion cue outside the quoted literals reads the payload as data). source_lines_max records the measured 32176 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20419."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 specification-red fixes: test_generation.rs and shell_command_compose.rs leave an agent opt-in to the agent flow, and creative_composition.rs links each kept brainstorm candidate, for 15 promoted-core lines; source_lines_max records the measured 32191 and outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 requirement-drafting batch (issues #1172, #1176, #1177, #1186). Four sources joined the ledger as promoted interpreters, each reading its vocabulary from seed data: statistics/word_relations.rs (R1176-2 quantity relations), factual_qa.rs and prompt_text_question.rs (R1172-2, R1172-6 and R1172-7 subject-verified lookup, fact comparison and questions over supplied text), and formalization_task_targets.rs (R1186-5 and R1186-6 deformalization from Lean 4, Rocq and Links Notation, split from formalization_task.rs to keep it under the line gate). sql_synthesis.rs grew with the seeded GROUP BY, HAVING and JOIN readings (R1177-3), shell_command_compose.rs with the seeded sed substitution (R1177-4), code_debugging.rs with the seeded loop-bound and condition-assignment defect classes (R1177-1), formalization_task.rs and formalization_task_render.rs with the negative-clause and round-trip arms, statistics.rs and mod.rs with the dispatch and re-exports, and benchmark_prompts.rs (migration debt) by one line where try_fact_lookup hands to the subject gate. source_file_count_max records 82, source_lines_max the measured 34055 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20428; every baseline is the measured tree."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the issue #1163 drafting batch: rust/src/solver_handlers/page_query_text.rs joins the ledger as a promoted interpreter (R1163-10, page queries from the seed's page_query templates over a page the prompt supplies), so source_file_count_max records 83 and source_lines_max the measured 34003; outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1172 R3 and R8: rust/src/solver_handlers/fact_live_answer.rs joins the ledger as a promoted interpreter (the live Wikidata answer and the researched explanation of the fact_lookup row, reading every surface and template from seed data), and solver_handlers/mod.rs grew by its six re-export lines, so source_file_count_max records 84, source_lines_max adds 324 lines and outside_core_lines_max 6."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for issue #1186 R4 (the prover step). rust/src/solver_handlers/formalization_task_prover.rs joins the ledger as a promoted interpreter (326 lines), raising source_file_count_max to 88; formalization_task_render.rs (584 to 553) and formalization_task_targets.rs (390 to 369) shed the PATH-only prover lookup the new file replaces, formalization_task.rs grew by its include and module doc (531 to 535), and mod.rs (migration debt) by two re-export lines (796 to 798). source_lines_max adds the net 280 lines and outside_core_lines_max the 2; rows other batches grew are theirs to re-measure."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1172 R1172-7: prompt_text_question.rs gained the statement projection (282 to 538 lines), every preposition, temporal surface, question word and slot label read from data/seed/meanings-facts.lino and data/seed/multilingual-responses-entities.lino. source_lines_max records the measured 35068."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for the issue #918 minimal-core batch (R914-6): conversation_topic, source_refresh and source_conflict left Rust for rule sets of data/seed/handler-rules.lino walked by the generic rule interpreter, their four-language prose now seed responses. benchmark_prompts.rs shed the conversation-topic opener reader and its wording (641 to 551 lines) and solver_handlers/mod.rs its three re-exports (814 to 811 lines); retrieval_procedures.rs, outside this census, lost the refresh and conflict procedures. source_lines_max records the measured 36963 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20571. The second batch moved execution_failure into the same rule document (solver_handlers/mod.rs 811 to 780 lines) and the incompatible-units wording into a seed response (solver_handler_units.rs 221 to 226 lines, the render call outgrowing the format string it replaces); source_lines_max records the measured 36937 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20545. The third batch moved the research follow-ups onto their procedure seed: research_table.rs reads its columns, statuses, whole-prompt follow-ups and wording from data/seed/research-table-procedure.lino and seeded responses instead of two slug enums, a nineteen-phrase match and four format strings (548 to 490 lines); source_lines_max records the measured 36879 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20487. The fourth batch moved network_query into the rule document (the dispatcher module drops its re-export, 780 to 779 lines; retrieval_procedures.rs and solver_helpers/code.rs, outside this census, lose the procedure and its English cue reader); source_lines_max records the measured 36878 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20486."
  component retrieval_method_interpreter
    file rust/src/retrieval_method.rs
    kind "Generic interpreter"
    reason "One retrieval procedure over data/seed/sources-registry.lino: resolve the prompt's unknown subject from the lexicon, consult the sources the registry declares for the need, read the capture cache or fetch, and render with provenance from the seed template. It embeds no domain vocabulary, no canned answer and no routing rule, so it passes the promotion test as a generic interpreter, not a handler; the M2 migration leaves retire the retrieval handlers into it."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 fourth drafting batch (issues #1175, #1180, #1185, #1186). rust/src/solver_handlers/formalization_task_rml.rs joins the ledger as a promoted interpreter (R1186-4 and R1186-6, the rml export step), raising source_file_count_max to 85; formalization_task.rs, formalization_task_render.rs and mod.rs grew by the include, the rml_check honesty field and the re-exports, and software_project.rs (migration debt) by the ten-line approval-claim predicate the R1175-3 claim router reads. statistics.rs, statistics/word_relations.rs and page_query_text.rs were re-measured at their concurrent-batch sizes so every baseline is the measured tree; both line ceilings record the measured counts."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 issue #1175 claim-row pass: web_requests.rs gained http_fetch_claims, the structural check the new http_fetch claim row in data/seed/capability-routing.lino consults before the handler runs (743 to 752 lines). source_lines_max records the measured 34739 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20458."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1164 R1164-11: page_query_text.rs gained the supplied-page decomposition arm (69 to 142 lines), which runs the code-example decomposer over the code blocks of a page the prompt supplies when the query line evidences the seed meaning code_example_decomposition_request, the route the shared cross-runtime-synthesis case e1164_supplied_page_code_example_parts reaches in both runtimes. source_lines_max records the measured 34812; outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the PR #1188 issue #1172 R7 language-parity fix: formalization_task.rs gained verb_final_language, which reads the verb_final flag of data/seed/formal-targets.lino (518 to 531 lines), and prompt_text_question.rs declines a sentence in a verb-final language through it (538 to 540 lines), because such a language marks time and place with postpositions the phrase reader does not read. source_lines_max records the measured 35083."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for the issue #1177 requirement closure (R1177-2, R1177-5, R1177-7): regex_witness.rs joins the ledger as a promoted matcher (the native twin of the browser RegExp check over examples derived from the composed constraints); regex_synthesis.rs grew by its witness hand-off (419 to 488), code_explanation.rs by the generic head, only and infix readers of seed construct rows and the listing of unmatched lines (467 to 600), and test_generation.rs by the stated-example reader and the named refusal that replaces the smoke skeleton (441 to 608). source_file_count_max records 86 and source_lines_max adds 733 lines; outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1176 R1176-1: unit_conversion.rs reads the captured Wikidata P2370 statements (data/seed/wikidata-conversion-to-si.lino) at answer time, resolves each unit of a linear conversion to its item, derives the factor from the two amounts and renders the localized grounding sentence (426 to 593 lines); source_lines_max adds 167 lines and outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1172 R1172-5: word_definition.rs joins the ledger as a promoted reader (definitions from the registry dictionary sources, every surface and template in seed data; 342 lines), and solver_handlers/mod.rs grew by its three re-export lines (793 to 796), so source_file_count_max records 87, source_lines_max adds 345 lines and outside_core_lines_max 3."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1175 R1175-3 (refusal group): test_generation.rs and format_conversion.rs expose the operand readers the claim router reads as function_under_test and structured_document evidence (608 to 616 and 648 to 650 lines; format_conversion.rs was also brought to rustfmt layout), so source_lines_max adds 10 lines; outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1177 R1177-9 and #1173 R1173-3: format_conversion.rs reads a CSV table (the seeded csv_to_json cue, a header of unique names, quoted fields) into JSON with every value a string and checks the parse-back cell by cell (650 to 799 lines), so source_lines_max adds 149 lines; outside_core_lines_max is unchanged."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-07 for issue #1173 R1173-3: compound_interest.rs (migration debt) reads the term from the earliest year-unit surface that has a number before it, so the year inside compounded yearly no longer hides the stated term (558 to 569 lines); source_lines_max and outside_core_lines_max add 11 lines."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for issue #1175 R1175-3 classes b, c and e: sixteen rows expose the reader each handler already runs as a boolean claim-evidence function the capability router reads (names_advice_topic, names_cached_destination, names_pattern_constraints, names_query_table, names_filesystem_object, names_document_format, carries_install_steps, names_conversation_topic, names_coreference_antecedent, follows_research_request, continues_software_project, names_list_items, continues_numeric_list, parses_text_operation, names_shell_command, names_marketplace, names_mechanism_subject), solver_handler_how.rs records the how_it_works refusal event of its no-context arm, and solver_handlers/mod.rs re-exports them, for 182 lines; source_lines_max adds 182 and outside_core_lines_max adds the 108 of the migrate rows. No rule or vocabulary moved into Rust: each function calls the handler reader it wraps."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for the PR #1188 clippy and unit fixes: solver_handler_units.rs grew with the issue #1176 CJK boundary rule (a unit also counts after a digit or before a non-letter, so 26.2英里是多少公里 reads its units; 214 to 221), and regex_witness.rs (364 to 363), test_generation.rs (616 to 617) and word_definition.rs (342 to 348) were reflowed by clippy fixes (merged match arms, map_or_else, an allow attribute for the frame slot, a split doc paragraph); no capability moved into Rust. source_lines_max records the measured 36973 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20589."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for issue #1165 R1165-4: solver_handler_oracle.rs fell from 127 to 124 lines because the coding oracle's answer (the documentation route first, then a cached snapshot) moved into rust/src/knowledge.rs as CodingOracle::answer, which the handler now calls; source_lines_max records the measured 36970 and outside_core_lines_max the measured 20586."
  note "Re-measured 2026-10-08 for the issue #1175 R1175-3 follow-up round: the handlers that answered without their input record a named refusal event in that branch (conversation_memory/mod.rs and conversation_summary.rs the conversation_recall refusal, benchmark_prompts.rs the summarization, brainstorming and roleplay refusals, document_originality.rs the unsupplied-document refusal with its names_document_operand reader, user_intent.rs the unstated-claim refusal with names_stated_claim, solver_handlers/mod.rs the translation and algorithm refusals and three re-exports), creative_composition.rs reads the advice request through the canonical prompt (issue #1173 R3 p003), and solver_handler_how.rs exposes mechanism_subject_term, for 86 lines; source_lines_max adds 86 and outside_core_lines_max the 78 of the migrate rows. No vocabulary moved into Rust."
